# Plugin Hub APIs

Review comments from the Plugin Hub are permanent limits.

- Do not call `LinkBrowser.open` or `Desktop.open`. There is no setting that opens the sounds folder.
- Do all file I/O through `net.runelite.client.util.Filepath`. Do not use `java.io.File`, `java.nio.file.Files`, or `java.nio.file.Path` in plugin code.
- The sounds folder is `getPluginDirectory()`. `@PluginDescriptor` must set `internalName = "all-drop-sounds"` so that directory stays `.runelite/plugin-data/all-drop-sounds`.
- Play wavs with `AudioPlayer.play(Filepath, float)`. Do not import `javax.sound`.
